OL,3,GNEWSARick Wakeman plays Life on Mars?
OL,4,Aon red planet test site
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran keyboard player Rick Wakeman
OL,7,Fhas achieved a "career first" by
OL,8,Fperforming Life on Mars? on a giant
OL,9,Fsand pit that mimics the surface of the
OL,10,FRed Planet.
OL,12,FThe performer recreated the part he
OL,13,Fplayed on David Bowie's 1973 single
OL,14,Frelease on a digital piano at the
OL,15,FAirbus Space Facility in Stevenage,
OL,16,FHertfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
PN,37102
