OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1794833805
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARick Wakeman plays Life on Mars?
OL,4,Aon red planet test site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe indoor terrain, about the size of a
OL,7,Fbasketball court, was used to test
OL,8,Fsystems for the ExoMars Rosalind
OL,9,FFranklin rover, which Europe plans to
OL,10,Fsend to Mars, with a launch scheduled
OL,11,Ffor 2028.
OL,13,FWakeman, best known for his solo career
OL,14,Fand time in the band Yes, said it was
OL,15,Fthe closest he would get to performing
OL,16,Fon the surface of the Red Planet and
OL,17,Fthat he was sure Bowie would have
OL,18,F"loved" the one-off gig.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
